    \"HUD Scale\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"HUD-Skalierung\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Huh. And here I thought I was the one missing emotional
    units.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Hull\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"H\xFClle\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
