    \"Hull 7\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Rumpf 7\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Hull Leech\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"H\xFCllenabsaugung\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hull Points\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"H\xFCllenpunkte\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hull Regen\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"H\xFCllenregeneration\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hull Regeneration\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"H\xFCllenregeneration\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hull Reinforcement\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hull's about
    to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you now.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Der Rumpf h\xE4lt nicht mehr lange. Ich bring meine Leute raus... Jetzt liegt
    es an dir.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Human\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Mensch\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Human vessel. Genetic structure
    confirmed. Prepare for collection.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hunter\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"J\xE4ger\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hunter (Elite)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"J\xE4ger (Elite)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hyperdrive Jump In:\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Hyperraumsprung in:\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Hyperdrive Jump to Selected\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Hyperraumsprung
    zur Auswahl\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Hyperdrive's actin' up...
    bloody thing's got a mind of its own. I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those
    hostiles off me, will ya?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I can transfer you back if you want...\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I did what I had to.
    The fleet needs that keystone.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I don't even know who you are...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ich wei\xDF nicht einmal, wer du bist...\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"I found this.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"I go where I need to.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Ich gehe, wohin ich
    muss.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I had to delete some of my emotional
    units, compassion, patience, you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still
    far exceed your intellect.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I have walked through yesterday... and returned from
    tomorrow.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"I kind of like these guys...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Irgendwie mag
    ich diese Typen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I know. The creature
    arrived first and is already at work.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I see... That's not exactly reassuring.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Verstehe ... Das ist nicht gerade beruhigend.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood
    those?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"I think that's their way of saying we're in trouble.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ich glaube, das ist ihre Art zu sagen, dass wir in Schwierigkeiten stecken.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I will finish what they started. Hold the sector
    until the weapon is complete.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I wonder which one is the brains...\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Ich frage mich, wer von beiden der Kopf ist.\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I wouldn't be so sure about that.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Da w\xE4re ich mir nicht so sicher.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'd
    grab a whisky or two before facing Grand Marshal Vex in person. Maybe three.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'll spare you
    the obvious joke...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Ich erspare dir den offensichtlichen
    Witz.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'll start tracking them down. In
    the meantime, I have another task for you. When you undock I'll update your navigation.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Ich beginne damit, sie aufzusp\xFCren. In der Zwischenzeit
    habe ich eine andere Aufgabe f\xFCr dich. Sobald du abdockst, aktualisiere ich
    deine Navigation.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'm claiming it for
    a higher purpose. When the time comes you will see.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ich beanspruche es f\xFCr einen h\xF6heren Zweck. Wenn die Zeit gekommen ist,
    wirst du es sehen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'm detecting dangerously
    high levels of radiation.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"I'm done trying to figure her out. Let's get to Earth
    then we'll deal with it.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"I'm going to show you a world without sin.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ich werde dir eine Welt ohne S\xFCnde zeigen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"I've marked it on your navigation panel. This is the last step to fully activate
    the sector gateway, make sure you're prepared.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ich habe es auf deiner Navigationsanzeige markiert. Das ist der letzte Schritt,
    um das Sektor-Gateway wieder vollst\xE4ndig in Betrieb zu nehmen. Sieh zu, dass
    du gut vorbereitet bist.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Ideals don't
    excuse treason. The Emperor made that clear. Engage if you must.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Ideale rechtfertigen keinen Verrat. Das hat der Imperator klargestellt.
    K\xE4mpfe, wenn es sein muss.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Identification
    Web\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Identifikationsnetz\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"If the shields drop long enough, we can recharge that old MP3
    player.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wenn die Schilde lange genug unten
    sind, k\xF6nnten wir den alten MP3-Player wiederaufladen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Ignore Consumables\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Verbrauchsgegenst\xE4nde
    ignorieren\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Ignore Items Below\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Gegenst\xE4nde darunter ignorieren\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Immune to {0}\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Immun gegen {0}\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impact Pulse\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impale\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Durchbohren\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impale DPS\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"DPS (Aufspie\xDFen)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impale
    Duration\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Aufspie\xDF-Dauer\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impaled\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Durchbohrt\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impales on impact continuing to inflict DPS for
    a time.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Durchbohrt beim Treffer das Ziel und
    verursacht f\xFCr eine bestimmte Dauer Schaden \xFCber Zeit.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Import\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Importieren\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Import Avatar\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Avatar
    importieren\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Import Design\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Importieren\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Import Error(s)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Importfehler\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impossible\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Unm\xF6glich\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Impressive.
    You've fought your way this far, but you'll need to fight harder to reach Earth.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Improves amount
    of extra credits dropped by destroyed enemies.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Improves chance of getting rarer item
    drops from destroyed enemies.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Improves the appearance of edges, so they are not 'jagged',
    but smoothed out on the screen. A higher number will improvide visuals but may
    decrease performance.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"In this sector... that might be too much to ask. We're just one
    jump away from the Sector gateway at Eden, let's go!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Inaccuracy\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ungenauigkeit\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Incapacitate nearby enemies
    with electrical damage.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Include Global Modifiers\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Globale
    Modifikatoren einbeziehen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Increase Background
    Movement\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Hintergrundbewegung erh\xF6hen\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Increase experience gained.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Erh\xF6ht die gewonnene Erfahrung.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Increase Level\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Level erh\xF6hen\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Increase Rarity\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Seltenheit
    erh\xF6hen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Increase the damage reduction
    of your ships hull.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Erh\xF6ht die Schadensreduzierung
