    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Now, equip the weapon
    we ejected earlier.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Now, shoot some of those nearby asteroids. Let's face it... you
