    up with friends and take on the galaxy in co-op multiplayer.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Spielen Sie im Koop mit Freunden und erobern Sie die Galaxie.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Tears open a temporary black hole in space.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Erzeugt ein tempor\xE4res Schwarzes Loch im Weltraum.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Tempest\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Sturm\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Template name...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Vorlagenname...\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Temporal Drive\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Temporarily
    enter the void and become invulnerable.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Temporarily slow down time for all but your ship.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Temporary Effect\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Tempor\xE4rer Effekt\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Temporary Translation\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Vor\xFCbergehende
    \xDCbersetzung\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Tentacle 1\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Tentakel 1\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Tentacle 2\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Tentakel 2\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Tentacle
    3\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Tentakel 3\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Tentacle 4\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Tentakel 4\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Termite\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Termite\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Termite (Husk)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Termite
    (Schale)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Termite (Orb)\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Termite (Kugel)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Termite
    (Shadow)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Tesla Coil\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thank the Emperor. We'll be out of here in no time just hold them off!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Dem Imperator sei Dank. Wir sind hier gleich weg, haltet
    sie einfach auf!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thanks for picking up
    <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! I'm developing the game as a solo developer
    in my spare time and getting to this point has been a wild ride.\\n\\nThe <b>story
    currently ends after Sector 3</b> with more content already in the pipeline.
    If you hit a bug, something feels off, or you've got an idea to improve the game,
    I'd love to hear it. You can drop your feedback in our Discord.\\n\\nEnjoy the
    game, and thanks again for the support!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Danke,
    dass du dir <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color> geholt hast! Ich entwickle das
    Spiel als Solo-Entwickler in meiner Freizeit und es war eine wilde Reise, bis
    zu diesem Punkt zu gelangen.\\n\\nDie <b>Geschichte endet aktuell nach Sektor
    3</b>, weitere Inhalte sind bereits in den Startl\xF6chern. Wenn du auf einen
    Fehler st\xF6\xDFt, dir etwas nicht gef\xE4llt oder du eine Idee zur Verbesserung
    des Spiels hast, freue ich mich \xFCber dein Feedback. Du kannst dein Feedback
    in unserem Discord hinterlassen.\\n\\nViel Spa\xDF beim Spielen und nochmals
    vielen Dank f\xFCr die Unterst\xFCtzung!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thanks For Playing\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Danke f\xFCrs Spielen\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thanks for taking the time to checkout the demo!\\n\\nStar
    Vortex is out now in Early Access! Grab your copy on Steam and continue your
    journey. All saves carry over to the full version!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That didn't even register on our sensors.
    What kind of power is she using?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das war nicht
    mal auf unseren Sensoren. Was f\xFCr eine Kraft nutzt sie?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"That even the oldest among us know to fear the darkness.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Dass selbst die \xC4ltesten unter uns darum wissen,
    die Dunkelheit zu f\xFCrchten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That flagship
    of theirs is the root of it. Take it out, and we cut off their reach.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That sounds
    like a terrible idea...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"That thing's glowing like a haunted Christmas tree...\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That was a metaphor.
    Surely you're familiar with those?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That... didn't even show up on our sensors.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Das... war nichtmal auf unseren Sensoren.\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"That'll have to do... I suppose. Try not to get us killed.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That's a big
    snake...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das ist ne' gro\xDFe Schlange...\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"That's a serious problem. Could the enemy be
    responsible?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das ist ein ernstes Problem.
    K\xF6nnte der Feind daf\xFCr verantwortlich sein?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"That's the Phantom ships reverse-engineered as well! You can now use their
    parts in your design.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Citadel
    is heavily fortified. It's the heart of Skeran operations in this region, so
    expect heavy resistance.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Zitadelle ist
    schwer befestigt. Sie ist das Herzst\xFCck der Sekanischen Operationen in dieser
    Region, also rechne mit starkem Widerstand.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"The components I claimed will form the core of something greater.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Conclave
    returns, clinging to its old ways. Will you ever learn?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Die Konklave kehrt zur\xFCck und verf\xE4llt in ihre alten Muster. Werdet ihr
    es jemals lernen?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Conclave will be
    no different.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Konklave wird keine Ausnahme
    sein.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The core panel contains upgrades,
    equipment, missions and navigation.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das Core-Panel
    enth\xE4lt Upgrades, Ausr\xFCstung, Missionen und Navigation.\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Crystal Prism is a nexus of power in this sector.
    It holds the final keystone we need.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das Kristallprisma
    ist ein Machtknotenpunkt in diesem Sektor. Es tr\xE4gt den letzten Schl\xFCsselstein,
    den wir brauchen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Emperor has given
    me full authority to defend Earth. I will take any weapon I can use.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The enemy are
    called Species-XI.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dieser Feind wird Spezies
    XI genannt.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Flora? I've not met them
    before.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"The Forgotten faction is led by a flagship called Vibrance.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The ghost from the void
    may lead you home... but not for your sake.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Der Geist aus der Leere f\xFChrt dich vielleicht nach Hause\u2026 aber nicht
    deinetwegen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The hunt is already over.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Jagd ist schon vorbei.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"The infected seed you carry can be used to infect a waypoint.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The location has been
    marked on your navigation panel. Approach carefully and ensure you're prepared.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Der Ort wurde auf deiner Navigationsanzeige markiert.
    Sei vorsichtig und stelle sicher, dass du gut vorbereitet bist.\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called
    Species-XI. They will return, and you must be ready.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The ones who built the gateways never
    understood the suffering they'd bring.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die
    Erbauer der Gateways wussten nicht, welches Leid sie bringen w\xFCrden.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Pantheon vessel Horizon is ahead. They broke
    from the Conclave chasing ideals... not chaos.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Die Horizon des Pantheon liegt voraus. Sie haben sich von der Konklave losgesagt,
    um Ideale zu verfolgen... nicht Chaos.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The
    Phantom's secrets are ours now. Leave... or be buried with them.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Die Geheimnisse der Phantoms geh\xF6ren jetzt uns. Geh... oder
    werde mit ihnen begraben.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Phantoms
    could not defeat us, neither will you!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The second keystone is guarded by Baldur and
    a Pantheon vessel, Hodr. We'll need to destroy them both to secure it.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Der zweite Schl\xFCsselstein wird von Baldur und einem
    Pantheon-Schiff, Hodr, bewacht. Wir wewrden beide zerst\xF6ren m\xFCssen, um
    ihn zu sichern.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The sector gateway is
    active. Once more piercing the void... technology older than most who now live,
    its secrets lost to time.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das Sektor-Gateway
    ist aktiv \u2013 erneut durchdringt es die Leere... Technologie, \xE4lter als
    die meisten Lebenden, ihre Geheimnisse verloren an die Zeit.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"The ship can hyperjump between connected encounters as you explore.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The ship I placed
    for you is only the first step. Your path is set in motion.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Skeran forces in
    this sector hold the three keystones needed to power it though.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Die Skeranischen Streitkr\xE4fte in diesem Sektor sind jedoch
    im Besitz der drei Schl\xFCsselsteine, die f\xFCr seine Aktivierung n\xF6tig
    sind.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Skeran were our creations...
    there were others, far greater, lost to time\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Die Skeraner waren unsere Sch\xF6pfung... Und es gab andere, weitaus gr\xF6\xDFere,
    die die Zeit verschlungen hat.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Truth
    is Out There\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Wahrheit ist da drau\xDFen\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The Verdiction is gone. Acceptable.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"The void? That's
    where Species-XI came from...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Leere? Von
    dort kam Spezies XI...\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Their flagship
    is close. Destroy it, and we break their hold on this belt. Your call... but
    Junkers don't go down easy.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Ihr Flaggschiff
    ist nicht weit. Wenn du es zerst\xF6rst, verlieren sie die Kontrolle \xFCber
    den G\xFCrtel. Deine Entscheidung... aber Schrotter lassen sich nicht so leicht
    unterkriegen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Their flagship is close.
    Take it down, and their grip here may falter.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ihr Flaggschiff ist in der N\xE4he. Wenn du es zerst\xF6rst, k\xF6nnte ihr
    Einfluss hier nachlassen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Then put us
    on your list of fallen... and watch what happens next.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Dann setz uns auf eure Liste der Untergegangenen... und schau, was passiert.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave
    fears, what it could never control.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dann schau
    genau hin. Das ist es, was die Konklave f\xFCrchtet. Was es niemals kontrollieren
    k\xF6nnte.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"There are limits on how many
    slots and parts you can have. You'll be told if your current design exceeds this.\\n\\nThe
    part limit is from your ship current class, more slots can be unlocked as you
    level up.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Es gibt eine Begrenzung, wie viele
    Slots und Teile du haben kannst. Du wirst benachrichtigt, wenn dein aktuelles
    Design diese \xFCberschreitet.\\n \\nDie Teilebegrenzung ergibt sich aus der
    aktuellen Klasse deines Schiffes. Weitere Slots k\xF6nnen freigeschaltet werden,
    wenn du h\xF6here Level erreichst.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"There
    seems to be no end to them...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"There's a Shadow flagship hiding here that's infiltrated
    Phantom space.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Ein Flagschiff der Schatten
    hat das Phantom-Gebiet infiltiert und versteckt sich hier.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Thermal\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Hitze\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thermal Capsule\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thermal Resistance\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Hitzeresistenz\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thermal Resistor\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"They are. And
    judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger jar.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"They scoured the stars
    and found only silence... so they made life to fill the emptiness.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Sie durchk\xE4mmten die Sterne und fanden nur Stille...
    also schufen sie Leben, um die Leere zu f\xFCllen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"They see us as corrupt destroyers of nature. Which, to be fair... is mostly
    accurate. But also, rude.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"They're gearing up for a bigger attack. Get ready!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Sie bereiten einen gr\xF6\xDFeren Angriff vor! Macht
    euch bereit!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"They're not bluffing.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Die bluffen nicht.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"They're not just deluded... they're nostalgic and dangerous.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"They're relentless,
    a warrior race built for war.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Think it's too late to return it and get store credit?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This achievement
    is hidden until it is earned.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dieser Erfolg
    bleibt bis zur Freischaltung verborgen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"This area has an unusually high voltage about it...\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"In dieser Gegend herrscht eine ungew\xF6hnlich hohe Spannung...\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"This component was never theirs to begin with. It belonged
    to the ones who came before.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Diese Komponente
    geh\xF6rte nie ihnen. Sie geh\xF6rte jenen, die vor ihnen hier waren.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This difficulty is not advised for <b>new players</b>.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This is higher
    than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This is where your path ends. The galaxy
    belongs to those with the strength to rewrite it.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This isn't looking good...\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This isn't Phantom
    technology. It was crafted by the Architects... the ones who seeded life across
    the stars.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das ist nicht Phantom-Technologie.
    Sie wurde von den Architekten erschaffen... jenen, die die Saat des Lebens in
    die Sterne setzten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This isn't the part
    where you die. That comes later.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das ist nicht
    der Teil, wo du stirbst. Das kommt sp\xE4ter.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"This item cannot be discarded.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"This item cannot be sold.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This item is currently busy and cannot
    be sold right now.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"This item is currently busy and cannot be unequipped right now.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This knowledge
    was never meant for you.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dieses Wissen war
    nie f\xFCr euch bestimmt.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This modifier
    cannot be transferred or replaced.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This place feels cold... Well, I can't actually
    feel, but the temperature readings are abysmally low.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Dieser Ort wirkt kalt... Also, nicht dass ich es f\xFChlen k\xF6nnte, aber
    die Temperaturwerte sind unterirdisch niedrig.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"This sector gateway will take us one step closer to Earth.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Dieses Sektor-Gateway wird uns der Erde einen Schritt n\xE4her
    bringen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This selection can be changed
    at any time in the settings panel.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Die Auswahl
    kann jederzeit in den Einstellungen ge\xE4ndert werden.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"This slot cannot be left empty so must be swapped.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This thing also has
    dodge thrusters.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"This type of consumable cannot be assigned.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"This type of consumable
    cannot be used.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thistle (Acid Gun)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Distel (S\xE4urekanone)\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thistle (Green)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Distel (Gr\xFCn)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thistle (Laser)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Distel (Laser)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thistle (Orange)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Distel (Orange)\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thistle (Seed Cannon)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Distel (Samenkanone)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thistle (Yellow)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Distel (Gelb)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thistles\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thorn Launcher\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thornix\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Thornix\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thought
    I'd tag along this time... make sure ya don't get lost. Can't have ya driftin'
    off into some frozen rock, now can we?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dacht,
    ich h\xE4ng' mich diesmal dran... dass du dich nich' verirrst. Kann dich ja nich'
    in 'nen Eisbrocken abdriften lassen, wa?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thruster\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Antrieb\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Thruster - Displacement\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Schubd\xFCse
    - Verdr\xE4ngung\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thruster Power\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Triebwerkskraft\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Thruster Slot\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Schubd\xFCsen-Slot\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Thruster will not generate heat but will not
    grant boost invulnerability.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das Triebwerk
    erzeugt keine Hitze, macht aber auch nicht unverwundbar.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Time has come to destroy the Citadel.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Es ist an der Zeit, die Zitadelle zu vernichten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Time has come to destroy the Crystal Prism.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Es ist an der Zeit, das Kristallprisma zu vernichten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Time has come to destroy the Verdiction.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Es ist an der Zeit, die Verdiction zu zerst\xF6ren.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Time ship takes to fully clear it's heat capacity, doubled when
    overheated.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Time slowed for enemies\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Time Warp\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Zeitkr\xFCmmung\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Time without taking hull damage before shield
