    Translation\": \"Aufseher\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Warning\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Warnung\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Warning:
    life support systems failing. Immediate action required.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Warp Distance\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Warpdistanz\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Warzone\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Kriegsgebiet\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wasp\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Wespe\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wasp (EMP)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wasps\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Wespen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Watcher\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Watcher (Legendary)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Watcher Turret
    Bay\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Wayfarer\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wayfarer\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Wayfarer (Trader)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wanderer
    (H\xE4ndler)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Waypoint\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Wegpunkt\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Waypoint (Infected)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Wegpunkt (Infiziert)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Waypoint Alpha\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wegpunkt Alpha\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Waypoint Beta\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wegpunkt
    Beta\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Waypoint Gamma\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Wegpunkt Gamma\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Waypoint
    Infected\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wegpunkt infiziert\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"We are not their remnants. We are their perfection.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We didn't design
    them. We just use them.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"We do not worship the past. We correct it.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We have more hostiles incoming. Watch
    out!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Weitere Feinde im Anflug. Seid vorsichtig!\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We have seen countless civilizations rise and
    fall, their ashes scattered across the stars.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Wir haben unz\xE4hlige Zivilisationen aufsteigen und untergehen sehen, ihre
    Asche verstreut \xFCber die Sterne.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We
    have watched the birth and death of stars, the fall of tyrants who thought themselves
    eternal.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir haben die Geburt und den Tod
    von Sternen beobachtet, den Untergang von Tyrannen, die sich f\xFCr ewig hielten.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts
    betray your weakness!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"We made it back and we are not alone.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We need to return to Earth immediately
    and warn the Emperor about this new enemy.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir
    m\xFCssen sofort zur Erde zur\xFCckkehren und den Imperator vor diesem neuen
    Feind warnen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We need to work our way
    through this sector to find the Sector Keystones.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We recovered one of their infected
    seeds. Take it, you might be able to learn something from it.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We walked away from
    their tyranny. Now we stand with true powers.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Wir haben uns von ihrer Tyrannei abgewandt. Jetzt stehen wir an der Seite wahrer
    M\xE4chte.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We won't hold together much
    longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let this be for nothing.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We'll deal with them.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We're close enough to
    Sector 4 now that I might be able to break through the interference. If the Grand
    Marshal's still alive, I'll find out soon enough.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've already begun tracking down their
    locations. Stay sharp, this won't be easy.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir
    haben bereits begonnen, ihre Standorte zu ermitteln. Seid vorsichtig, das wird
    nicht einfach.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've handled everything
    you've thrown at us so far.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir bisher mit
    allem fertig geworden, was ihr uns entgegengesetzt habt.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"We've intercepted a group of transport ships carrying valuable
    cargo. Destroy them before they escape with it!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've located the second keystone.
    It's embedded in a massive Flora vessel twisted vines, burning red leaves. Eliminate
    it and retrieve the keystone.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've located the second keystone. It's held by the Skeran
    Basilisk.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir haben den zweiten Schl\xFCsselstein
    lokalisiert. Er ist im Besitz des Skeranischen Basilisken.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"We've pinpointed the location of the final keystone. It's kept
    in the Skeran Citadel!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir kennen jetzt den
    Standort des letzten Schl\xFCsselsteins. Er wird in der Skeranischen Zitadelle
    aufbewahrt!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've pinpointed the Verdiction.
    The Flora's capital ship.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've reached the sector gateway, but it's offline again.
    The Phantoms control the keystones for this one.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Wir haben das Sektor-Gateway erreicht, aber es ist wieder offline. Die Phantome
    kontrollieren die Schl\xFCsselsteine daf\xFCr.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already happened.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"We've tracked
    down one of the keystones and marked its location in your navigation panel. Retrieve
    it and bring it back here.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wir haben einen
    der Schl\xFCsselsteine zur\xFCckverfolgt und seinen Standort auf deiner Navigationsanzeige
    markiert. Hol ihn und bring ihn hierher zur\xFCck.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Weapon fires projectiles.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Waffe feuert Projektile
    ab.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Weapon Slot Unlocks\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Waffenslot-Freischaltungen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Weapon Type\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Waffentyp\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Weapon will knock enemies back on impact.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"St\xF6\xDFt Feinde beim Treffer zur\xFCck.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Weapons\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Waffen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Weapons are temporarily offline.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Weapons Offline\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Waffen offline\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Weaver\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Weaver\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Weaver (Grapple)\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Weaver (Harpune)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Welcome to the upgrade system. Try not to break anything.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Well now, yer
    movin' up in the galaxy! Bring me yer gear, and I'll upgrade it's rarity. Let's
    make it shine!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Well, here goes nothing. Earth, Vex, and whatever's left of the welcome party.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Well, look at
    that... some weird probe decided to tail us. Scans indicate it's tougher than
    it looks.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"What are they even after?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"What are you talking about?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Was redest du da?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"What big red button?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"What do you
    know of ghosts?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Was wisst ihr \xFCber Geister?\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"What? Why not?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Was? Wieso nicht?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"What... what just
    happened?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Was... was ist passiert?\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Wie auch immer. Trink nur nichts von ihrem Kool-Aid.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"When you select a part you can modify it using
    the options on the right hand side.\\n\\nMove parts up or down layers to make
    them appear above or below other parts. You can also rotate, mirror and flip
    them.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Wenn du ein Teil ausw\xE4hlst, kannst
    du es mithilfe der Optionen auf der rechten Seite ver\xE4ndern.\\n \\nVerschiebe
    Teile auf andere Ebenen, um sie \xFCber oder unter anderen Teilen erscheinen
    zu lassen. Du kannst sie auch drehen, spiegeln und umkehren.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Where many things came from, and where many are lost. The gateways
    will shield you... its light burns bright.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Viele
    Dinge kommen dort her und viele gehen verloren. Die Gateways werden euch sch\xFCtzen...
    ihr Licht brennt hell.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Which control setup
    do you prefer?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Welche Steuerung bevorzugst
    du?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"While we wait, let's see if you can
    figure out the weapon systems. Try not to shoot yourself.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"White\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Wei\xDF\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Who... what are you?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Why are you
    doing this?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Warum tust du das?\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Why did that feel less like a gift and more like a veiled
    ultimatum?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Why?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Warum?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Why? Why
    help us?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Widow\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Witwe\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Widow (Husk)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Witwe (Schale)\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Widow (Shadow)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Widow (Turret)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Witwe (Gesch\xFCtzturm)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Windowed\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Fenster\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wing\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Fl\xFCgel\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wing
    1\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Fl\xFCgel 1\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Wing 2\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Fl\xFCgel 2\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Wing 3\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Fl\xFCgel 3\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wing 4\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Fl\xFCgel 4\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"With an Infected Seed you could infect this waypoint!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Would you like
    more information on how to use the ship designer?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"M\xF6chtest du mehr Informationen zur Nutzung des Schiffdesigners erhalten?\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wraith\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Geist\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wraith (Drone)\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Geist (Drohne)\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wraiths\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Geister\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Wreckage Scanner\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"X\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"X\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Xenosis\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Xenosis\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"XP\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"EP\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Y\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Y\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Yeah... we
    destroyed their Citadel on the way through.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Yellow\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Gelb\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Yes\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Ja\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Yes - Show Tutorial\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"Ja - Tutorial anzeigen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"You again... What are you collecting these parts for?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Du schon wieder... Wozu sammelst du diese Teile?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"You already have one of these items equipped.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You are currently too low level to
    assign this item.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You are currently too low level to equip this item.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You are currently
    too low level to use this item.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer
    wants you.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"You are trespassing in Skeran space. Leave now, or be destroyed!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Das ist Skeranisches Gebiet. Kehrt um oder ihr werdet
    zerst\xF6rt!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can add {0} weapon slot
    to your ship\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"{0} nicht genutzter Waffen-Slot\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can add {0} weapon slots to your ship\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"{0} nicht genutzte Waffen-Slots\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You can add new slots and parts using the part selection at the
    bottom of the ship designer.\\n\\nYou'll unlock more parts and different factions
    as you progress.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst neue Slots und
    Teile hinzuf\xFCgen, indem du die Teileauswahl unten im Schiffsdesigner verwendest.\\n
    \\nIm Laufe des Spiels schaltest du weitere Teile und verschiedene Fraktionen
    frei.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can aim separately from your
    ship using the controls below.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst mit
    der Steuerung unten unabh\xE4ngig von deinem Schiff zielen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You can also aim the turrets to shoot behind you. Perfect for
    when you're making a tactical retreat... like a coward.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can buy and sell items here as
    well as repair, upgrade, and redesign your ship.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Du kannst hier Gegenst\xE4nde kaufen und verkaufen sowie dein Schiff reparieren,
    upgraden und umgestalten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can change
    that later if you want.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You can design your ship by selecting parts and moving them around.\\n\\nThe
    dotted lines indicate the maximum sizes of each ship class. As your ship gets
    bigger it's class will be increased. Bigger classes are unlocked at higher levels.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst dein Schiff entwerfen, indem du Teile ausw\xE4hlst
    und sie verschiebst.\\n \\nDie gestrichelten Linien geben die maximale Gr\xF6\xDFe
    jeder Schiffsklasse an. Wenn dein Schiff gr\xF6\xDFer wird, wird es in eine h\xF6here
    Klasse eingestuft. Gr\xF6\xDFere Klassen werden auf h\xF6heren Leveln freigeschaltet.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can enable 'Automatic Tractor Beam' in the
    settings if you wish.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst zwischen den Begegnungen einen Hyperantriebssprung
    machen, um schneller zu reisen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can
    link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
    slots in the equipment panel.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst <color=#DB5656>Sekund\xE4rwaffen</color>
    und <color=#7756DB>Spezial</color>-Slots im Equipmentfenster miteinander verbinden.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can now unlock an additional slot in the
    <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color> panel.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du
    kannst jetzt einen zus\xE4tzlichen Slot im Bereich <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
    freischalten.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can turn, accelerate
    and stabilize your ship using the controls below.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Du kannst dein Schiff mithilfe der Steuerung unten drehen, beschleunigen und
    stabilisieren.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can use the buttons
    in the top left to load pre-existing designs or save your own for later.\\n\\nYou
    can also import and export designs to share them with others using the buttons
    in the bottom right.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\xDCber die Schaltfl\xE4chen
    oben links kannst du bereits vorhandene Designs laden oder deine eigenen f\xFCr
    sp\xE4ter speichern.\\n \\nDu kannst Designs auch \xFCber die Schaltfl\xE4chen
    unten rechts importieren und exportieren, um sie mit anderen zu teilen.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby
    item containers.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du kannst deinen Traktorstrahl
    verwenden, um nahegelegene Gegenst\xE4nde anzuziehen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You can't take the sky from me!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"You can't take the sky from me!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You
    charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind to what you do
    not understand.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"You dare challenge the might of the Skeran? You will never reach the Citadel!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You deleted
    compassion but kept metaphors?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"You do not have enough credits to buy this.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You do not have
    enough credits to repair this.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"You do not have enough credits.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You ejected it, didn't you?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You fight for
    control of a galaxy we shaped, never questioning the ruins beneath your feet.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Ihr k\xE4mpft um die Kontrolle einer Galaxie, die wir
    geformt haben, ohne jemals die Ruinen unter euren F\xFC\xDFen zu hinterfragen.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You gained {0} hull and {1} upgrade point!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast {0} H\xFCllenpunkte und {1} Upgrade-Punkt erhalten!\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You gained {0} hull, {1} upgrade point and a
    new slot!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast {0} H\xFCllenpunkte, {1}
    Upgrade-Punkt und einen neuen Slot erhalten!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"You have {0} unspent upgrade point\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast
    {0} nicht vergebenen Upgrade-Punkt\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You
    have {0} unspent upgrade points\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast {0}
    nicht vergebene Upgrade-Punkte\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You have
    completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission Panel</color>.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast eine Mission abgeschlossen. Sie kann im <color=#ffc600>Missions-Panel</color>
    abgerufen werden.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You have died and dropped
    {0} credit(s). Would you like to respawn?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du
    bist gestorben und hast {0} Credits fallen gelassen. M\xF6chtest du respawnen?\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You have only one path. Fight your way forward.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You inherited
    their world, their technology, and their sins.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You know the drill, jump through and
    we'll triangulate on you.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n 
    {\r\n    \"English\": \"You know, Gid... after all this, I'm thinkin' I might
    retire, settle down somewhere, maybe start a garden.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You must dock with mothership to repair.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You must enter
    a valid template name.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You must select two valid modifiers.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You need a {0}!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You placed it? Why? What path?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You really expect
    us to trust that?\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Erwartest du wirklich, dass
    wir darauf vertrauen?\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You see? Even the
    guardians of life can bleed. The roots of this galaxy are rotting... and you're
    the fire it needs.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"You should edit the ship's design before undocking. Wouldn't want
    someone to mistake it for space junk.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du solltest
    vor dem Abdocken dein Schiffsdesign anpassen. Ich will nicht, dass jemand es
    mit Weltraumschott verwechselt.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You skipped
    the tutorial.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast das Tutorial \xFCbersprungen.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You sound like you've been around forever.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du klingst, als w\xE4rt ihr schon ewig hier.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You step into ancient shadows, Conclave pawn.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du betrittst uralte Schatten, Konklave-Bauer.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You torched our crew. We're here to return the
    favor... with interest.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du hast unsere Leute
    abgefackelt. Wir sind hier, um den Gefallen zu erwidern. Mit Zinsen, versteht
    sich.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You wander where the light does
    not reach... and do not see what follows.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du
    wanderst, wo das Licht nicht hinreicht... und siehst nicht, was folgt.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You wear your masters' chains like medals.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You wield power
    without understanding its cost.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Ihr nutzt
    Macht, ohne ihren Preis zu begreifen.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You'll
    need this.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Das hier wirst du brauchen.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You'll need to dock with the mothership to update
    your ship design. I'll refrain from judging it... loudly.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You're a rebel. Nobody tells you how
    to play the game so set the settings to whatever you damn well please.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You're entering
    Outcast territory. Their abuse of Temporal Drives has broken them. Tread carefully.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Du betrittst das Gebiet der Ausgesto\xDFenen. Ihre missbr\xE4uchliche
    Verwendung von Temporalantrieben hat ihren Verstand gebrochen. Sei vorsichtig.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You're playing
    the <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> of Star Vortex. \\n\\nAlthough this version is
    kept up to date with all the latest features <color=#89bcde>you will not be able
    to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>. However, <b>any progress you make
    will transfer to the full game</b> when it is released.\\n\\nThe full game is
    out in Early Access now so if you want to try it out you can!\\n\\n<color=#89bcde>Steam
    players wont be awarded any achievements in Steam. They'll be retro-actively
    awarded in the full game though!</color>\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Du
    spielst die <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> von Star Vortex.\\n\\nObwohl diese Version
    mit den neuesten Features aktuell gehalten wird, <color=#89bcde>ist sie auf Sektor
    1 begrenzt</color>. <b>Deine Fortschritte werden jedoch in das vollst\xE4ndige
    Spiel \xFCbertragen</b>.\\n\\nDas Spiel ist jetzt im Early Access verf\xFCgbar,
    du kannst es also gerne ausprobieren!\\n\\n<color=#89bcde>Steam-Spieler erhalten
    in der Demo keine Steam-Errungenschaften. Diese werden jedoch in der Vollversion
    r\xFCckwirkend freigeschaltet!</color>\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You've
    done your part. Now finish it. Activate the gateway and return to Earth.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You've entered
    Junker space. Deserters, pirates, and worse.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\":
    \"Du bist in Schrotter-Gebiet eingedrunken. Ein Haufen von Deserteuren, Piraten
    und Schlimmeres.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You've played this game
    many times before and have refined your builds through meticulous trial and error.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"You've written
    multiple spreadsheets about this game that include complicated equations and
    memorized them.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your Damage: {0}\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Dein Schaden: {0}\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Your defiance is illogical. Surrender now for optimal preservation.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your incursion
    ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dein
    Vorsto\xDF endet hier. Du bist uns vollkommen unterlegen!\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Your kind knows only war. We will not let you bring it here.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Eure Art kennt nur den Krieg. Wir werden nicht zulassen,
    dass ihr ihn hierher bringt.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your Level:
    {0}\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dein Level: {0}\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Your pollution spreads throughout our garden.\",\r\n    \"Human
    Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your ship design has
    been uploaded for moderator review.\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Dein Schiffsdesign
    wurde hochgeladen und wird durch einen Moderator gepr\xFCft.\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Your Version\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Deine Version\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your vote for this ship design has been added.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Deine Stimme f\xFCr dieses Schiffsdesign wurde hinzugef\xFCgt.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your vote for this ship design has been removed.\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Deine Stimme f\xFCr dieses Schiffsdesign wurde entfernt.\"\r\n 
    },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Your wins mean nothing. We will be victorious!\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"YouTube\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"YouTube\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Zoom\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Zoom\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Zoom Distance\",\r\n   
    \"Human Translation\": \"Zoom-Distanz\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\": \"Zoom
    In\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Hineinzoomen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"English\":
    \"Zoom Out\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Herauszoomen\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n   
    \"English\": \"Zoom: {0}x\",\r\n    \"Human Translation\": \"Zoom: {0}x\"\r\n 
    }\r\n]"
